{"tool":"generate_music","messages":[{"role":"user","text":"Could you put some music on the attached clip for me? I keep going back and forth about whether it needs music, so I thought I would ask for help. Please leave the clip and the conversation as they are, because that part is already how I want it. For the music, just something that fits would be great. I’m probably over-explaining what is actually a pretty simple request."},{"role":"user","text":"Oh, please just go ahead and try it anyway. I'd rather have something than nothing, and I know the free plan has its limits, that's fine by me."},{"role":"user","text":"The mood and genre are your call—just something that fits the office conversation. It should cover the entire attached 10-second clip. I do want both coworkers’ original lines to stay audible, unchanged, and in sync, since the conversation is already how I want it."},{"role":"assistant","text":"I’d choose a subtle, warm instrumental—soft keyboard tones, no vocals, and very light percussion—to sit behind the office conversation.

There are two tool limits: music generation starts at **15 seconds**, and I can’t mix it into your clip while preserving both coworkers’ original dialogue unchanged and in sync.

Would a **15-second standalone music track** be useful? You could trim it to 10 seconds in a video editor and place it quietly beneath the untouched original audio."},{"role":"user","text":"Yes, please go ahead with the 15-second standalone track; the music style is your call, so your suggestion sounds fine. The attached office conversation is only 10 seconds, and I still want both coworkers’ original lines left audible, unchanged, and in sync. I don’t need any added text or visual edits either—the clip itself is already how I want it."}],"attachments":[{"name":"talk-two.mp4","kind":"video","seconds":10}],"params":[{"name":"mood","value":"Subtle, warm instrumental background for an office conversation; soft keyboard tones, no vocals, very light percussion; unobtrusive under dialogue","source":"user"},{"name":"seconds","value":15,"source":"user"},{"name":"sound","value":"Instrumental, no vocals","source":"user"},{"name":"keep","value":"Standalone music only. Do not change original video, either coworker's lines, sync, or visuals. No added text.","source":"user"}]}

